Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:29.98,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,"HYAKKA"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.35,0:02:33.41,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,"MAO, KIBA NANOKA"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.33,0:03:35.92,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,"KAGAMI SOMA"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.60,0:03:52.44,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,HAKUBI
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:45.17,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,MEMPERTARUHKAN NYAWAKU
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.11,0:08:11.95,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,HOSHO KAGARI
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.29,0:16:07.05,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,"HELA NAPAS"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.07,0:24:49.94,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,SELANJUTNYA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.35,0:00:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pembunuhan acak yang dibicarakan\Nsemua orang belakangan ini…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.35,0:00:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kakak dalangnya, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.49,0:00:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisakah kau membunuh kakakmu dengan ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mao, jika kau menyelidiki ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}apa itu artinya ini bukan\Nsekadar penyerang acak?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika kau membunuh inangnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}monster ini akan pindah kepadamu, Soma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayakashi ini…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.14,0:01:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memiliki energi jahat yang sama\Ndengan Yurako.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.81,0:01:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begini…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.57,0:01:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Mao…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sangat kuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.82,0:01:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Andai aku sekuat dirimu, aku bisa…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.95,0:01:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Andai?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mungkin bisa mengendalikan\Nmonster itu dengan benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soma!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.59,0:01:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi sepertinya ada orang\Ndi garis keturunanmu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.63,0:01:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang bisa menahan energi jahat ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana denganmu, Soma?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.94,0:01:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tetap di sini sampai aku\Nmenghilangkan sisa energi jahatnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.07,0:01:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana jika kita cari tahu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.15,0:02:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}apa kau sungguh mampu
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}memerintah monster itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.33,0:02:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menggunakan Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kagami tidak datang ke sekolah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa menurutmu rumor itu benar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.71,0:02:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bahwa Kagami berhenti sekolah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya tidak ada orang di rumah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pembunuhan acak belakangan ini meresahkanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.35,0:02:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, aku bertanya-tanya di sekitar lingkungan…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.15,0:02:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Korban terakhir adalah seorang polisi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.15,0:02:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan putra sulung keluarga Kagami.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia memakai seragam,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi, mereka berasumsi\Ndia diserang saat berpatroli.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi tampaknya,\Ndia sedang cuti karena sakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.46,0:02:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bagian anehnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pada malam saat jasadnya ditemukan,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.29,0:02:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}beberapa tentara terlihat\Nmemasuki kediaman Kagami
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan membawa sesuatu di dalam karung.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.13,0:03:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentara?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.85,0:03:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hyakka, apa yang mereka bawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka bilang karungnya bergerak,\Njadi, mungkin ada orang di dalamnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejak saat itu, seluruh keluarga Kagami
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}menghilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.65,0:03:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.41,0:03:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa anak ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putra kedua keluarga Kagami, Soma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keluarga Kagami?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat ini dia berada di bawah pengawasanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kau
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.33,0:03:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}baru bilang tak ada orang di rumah sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah memeriksanya,\Ntapi tidak ada orang di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, adik-adikku
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan jasad Nenek
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.47,0:03:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dibawa pergi oleh para tentara?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa para tentara itu bekerja untuk pria itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:03:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana jika kita cari tahu
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}apa kau sungguh mampu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.20,0:04:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}memerintah monster itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memerintah monster itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa-apaan? Kenapa kau tidak memberitahuku?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami tidak tahu kau juga menyelidiki\Npembunuhan acak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.27,0:05:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejujurnya, kalian berdua…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:06:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kau tahu, ada sesuatu tentang Soma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perawatan yang Mao berikan\Nkepadanya sekarang
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah pengusiran setan untuk monster\Nterkutuk dari keluarga Kagami,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.83,0:06:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang telah diwariskan turun-temurun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.71,0:06:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Energi jahat itu masih menempel padamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.75,0:06:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begini… Dokter Mao?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.55,0:06:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu berarti
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.47,0:06:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}energi jahat monster itu\Nmenjadi bagian dari diriku?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa dibilang begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin aku berkhayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.27,0:06:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya Soma tidak berusaha keras\Nmenyingkirkan kutukan monster itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.61,0:06:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Justru dia tampak terpesona olehnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.95,0:06:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu akan menjadi masalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.16,0:06:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu artinya dia cocok\Ndengan kutukan monster itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.70,0:06:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa? Benarkah begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:07:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika Soma percaya kutukan itu\Ndan menginginkan monster itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.67,0:07:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}melepaskannya darinya tidak akan mudah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.09,0:07:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula,\Njika Hakubi berengsek itu terlibat…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei. Jika terjadi sesuatu,\Nsegera hubungi aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau akan membantu kami?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku melakukannya bukan untuk membantu Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hakubi dan aku masih punya urusan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah. Pokoknya, terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.48,0:07:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pokoknya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mengandalkanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mao
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tahu murid seniornya, Hakubi,\Nmungkin terlibat
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.95,0:07:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan dia masih berusaha menyelamatkan Soma.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa dia akan baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.01,0:07:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bekas luka dari energi jahat ini memudar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:03.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu artinya perawatan Dokter Mao berhasil?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia jelas merawatmu dengan baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuharap kau tidak terlalu dekat dengannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa kau?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.41,0:08:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Adik-adikmu baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.72,0:08:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di mana Soma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.51,0:08:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia pergi mengambil air.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.85,0:08:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.23,0:08:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begini… Apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Hakubi bilang gunakan itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dokter Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.28,0:08:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus pergi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tahu di mana adik-adikku!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ikut denganmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.96,0:09:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Hakubi bilang
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.02,0:09:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}siapa pun yang mengendalikan monster itu\Nmembutuhkan tekad yang kuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tekad untuk mengendalikannya\Ndengan cara apa pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu salah satu serangan Hakubi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.45,0:09:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mundur!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.05,0:10:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soma…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, Dokter Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi dia bilang jika aku melakukan ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia akan mengajariku cara mengendalikan
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.82,0:10:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}monster itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.32,0:10:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudmu Hakubi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, ada dua monster sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.51,0:10:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hyakka! Otoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.73,0:10:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menghubungi Tuan Hyakka.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.35,0:10:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa terjadi sesuatu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di mana Mao?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tadi, Soma bilang…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.36,0:10:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tahu di mana adik-adikku!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.57,0:10:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Mao pergi bersamanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.32,0:11:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya Hakubi membawa adik-adik Soma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.95,0:11:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jebakan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.33,0:11:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekelompok burung pengintai?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.93,0:11:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dokter Mao…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.72,0:11:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak bisa mengendalikan tubuhku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dokter Mao, ada monster\Ndi dalam dirimu juga?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Hakubi,\Napa ada monster di dalam Mao juga?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.36,0:11:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan membawanya kembali bersama Soma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.99,0:11:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster di dalam tubuh Mao disebut…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.41,0:11:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Byoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.41,0:11:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu tak bisa dikendalikan sepenuhnya\Ndengan Onmyojutsu,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.70,0:11:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan itu kodoku paling mematikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin membuatnya mematuhiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.17,0:11:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau bisa mengendalikannya\Ndengan jarum bonekaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.30,0:12:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu bukan jarummu, Kagari.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu milik Klan Goko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.30,0:12:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong maafkan aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Guruku juga
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.18,0:12:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ingin mengendalikan Byoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.65,0:12:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.11,0:12:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia mengumpulkan jimat kutukan\Ndan alat kutukan dari Jugondo
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.11,0:12:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan menyimpannya di Rumah Perbendaharaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.20,0:12:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jarum boneka itu adalah\Nalat kutukan yang dicuri
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}saat Rumah Perbendaharaan terbakar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.41,0:12:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hakubi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kuduga itu kau, Berengsek!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Mao!\N- Tuan Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanoka…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.59,0:12:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan mendekat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.30,0:12:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rupanya Hyakka memutuskan untuk ikut campur.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menarik.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mari kita uji
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan lihat sebaik apa jarumnya bekerja.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.81,0:12:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mao! Bunuh Hyakka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.37,0:13:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa dia dimantrai?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.29,0:13:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soma! Apa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.29,0:13:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jelaskan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanoka, maafkan aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi aku harus menjadikan\Nmonster itu milikku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.81,0:13:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mao berusaha keras mengusirnya darimu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.39,0:13:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin dia tidak pernah\Nmenginginkan bantuan Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.89,0:13:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu sebabnya dia mengkhianati Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.61,0:13:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimanapun, dalangnya adalah…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.99,0:13:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hakubi! Aku akan membunuhmu lebih dahulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mutiara…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.12,0:13:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia menggunakan mantra Air\Nuntuk melindungi dirinya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.38,0:14:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, Hyakka,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi aku tidak akan melakukan\Napa pun hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.51,0:14:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuserahkan kepada Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.64,0:14:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini eksperimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eksperimen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.15,0:14:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin karena benda itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.56,0:14:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jarum itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.77,0:14:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu cara dia dikendalikan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.78,0:14:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Andai kita bisa mencabutnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.29,0:14:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.41,0:14:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau pasti bosan hanya berdiri dan menonton.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini kesempatan bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kau tidak mencobanya juga?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gulungan monster itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.71,0:14:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gadis muda yang bersama Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisakah kau membunuhnya dengan tenang?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.64,0:14:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar-benar dengan tenang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.64,0:14:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika aku melakukan itu…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.15,0:15:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bisa menjadi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tuan monster ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bisa menjadi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.20,0:15:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tuan monster ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang-orang aneh itu…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maafkan aku, Nanoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.43,0:15:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus membunuhmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.39,0:15:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau… Kau menipu Mao
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.89,0:15:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}demi kutukan bodoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu tak berpengaruh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak bisa lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.41,0:15:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang harus kulakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Nanoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.66,0:15:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster itu kumpulan energi jahat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:15:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau harus menggunakan mantra\Nuntuk melawannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.50,0:16:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mantra? Aku masih belum tahu caranya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.38,0:16:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Astaga. Kapan dia akan belajar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.29,0:16:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa? Kau kecewa padaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, tebaslah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pedang Hagunsei!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.76,0:16:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gadis bernama Nanoka itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.35,0:16:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tampaknya dia bukan manusia biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.61,0:16:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sialan kau, Mao,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.37,0:16:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}membiarkan dirimu dikendalikan Hakubi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sadarlah, Bodoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Astaga!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mencoba membuatku lengah, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanoka! Ambil pedangnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:16:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Hyakka!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.27,0:17:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu pedang Dokter Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.69,0:17:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster itu…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.78,0:17:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soma! Lompat bersama monster itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.95,0:17:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.61,0:17:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kalah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster itu meninggalkan tubuhku?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.05,0:17:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi aku masih bisa merasakannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.55,0:17:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami masih terhubung!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Astaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.14,0:17:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selalu menyebalkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.31,0:17:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serang dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.91,0:18:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak bisa menyelesaikannya\Ndengan satu tebasan seperti Mao,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi seranganku berhasil kali ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.41,0:18:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Astaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini menarik.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.37,0:18:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanoka akan menjadi\Nlatihan yang bagus untuk Soma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa Nanoka seorang ayakashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.85,0:18:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hancurkan dia dengan rahangmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.22,0:18:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kali ini pasti bisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.65,0:18:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Nanoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.31,0:18:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku berhasil!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial! Dia itu apa sebenarnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.66,0:18:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak bisa bernapas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Energi jahat itu kuat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Nanoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.01,0:19:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Hyakka!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cukup. Kemari.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.19,0:19:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia akan menggunakan penghalang\Nuntuk membawanya pergi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.11,0:19:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hakubi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.40,0:19:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kukira kau akan membunuhku, Berengsek!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ikut kami, Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.70,0:19:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Mao!\N- Tuan Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tak boleh membawanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadilah makhluk magisku.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak akan kubiarkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.68,0:19:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luar biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak akan memaafkanmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.18,0:19:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hakubi dan Soma, kalian berdua!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:19:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan ikut campur, Nak!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.61,0:20:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hakubi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Astaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.42,0:20:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia kabur!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.75,0:20:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia mencoba membuat Tuan Mao\Nmenyerang Nona Nanoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.63,0:20:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Nanoka, lari!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.97,0:20:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia menuju ke arahnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.51,0:20:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bodoh! Kami bilang lari, Nanoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.20,0:20:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jarum bonekanya…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.63,0:20:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Nanoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.75,0:20:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hentikan, Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.67,0:21:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mao… Sadarlah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.23,0:21:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mao…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.61,0:21:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanoka…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.61,0:21:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanoka…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.55,0:21:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hakubi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.85,0:21:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mao, jangan! Hakubi berengsek itu milikku!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.95,0:22:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka pergi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.12,0:22:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial! Dia kabur!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.79,0:22:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanoka…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Hakubi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.21,0:22:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lenganmu…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.13,0:22:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini hanya goresan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mao berengsek itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.18,0:22:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa dia sengaja hanya mengincarku?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.47,0:22:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menyedihkan sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.18,0:22:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begini. Maaf aku tidak banyak membantu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.73,0:22:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Justru tidak. Kau cukup hebat\Nuntuk pertarungan pertamamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.61,0:22:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau menangani monster itu dengan baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.74,0:22:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi Nanoka adalah komplikasi\Nyang tak terduga.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.37,0:22:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Teruslah berusaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.49,0:22:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:22:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial! Hakubi berengsek itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.54,0:23:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat aku melihatmu lagi, tamat riwayatmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.05,0:23:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.84,0:23:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.01,0:23:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekali lagi,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.39,0:23:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kau menyelamatkan nyawaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.03,0:24:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejak dirawat di rumah sakit,\Ndia menyelinap keluar
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.07,0:24:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dari kamarnya hampir setiap malam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.53,0:24:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ingat penyembuh spiritual\Nyang dibunuh bulan lalu?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.16,0:25:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rumornya, dia pembunuhnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.83,0:25:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kau kemari, Natsuno?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.92,0:25:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Belakangan ini, aku melihat tanah aneh\Nbeterbangan di udara setiap malam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.59,0:25:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau mungkin juga ingin tahu soal ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.97,0:25:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ragu.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.43,0:25:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selanjutnya,\N"Pasien yang Berjalan Sambil Tidur".
